{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "27", "m": "07", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "09", "M": "24", "S": "45"}}, "news": [{"title": "Indore: IMC issues fire safety directives to building owners, commercial establishments", "para": "To enforce compliance, IMC is conducting a city-wide inspection drive. Property owners or operators found misusing basements or rooftops in violation of National Building Code (2016) Part-4 standards and prevailing building bylaws and safety standards will face formal notices and legal action.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/indore-imc-issues-fire-safety-directives-to-building-owners-commercial-establishments/132654269?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-1152489/132654269.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}, {"title": "Thiruvananthapuram: Housing project in limbo, families left waiting", "para": "The Thanal Housing Project in Muttathara remains stalled, affecting nearly one hundred families. Fresh technical and cost hurdles prevent the contractor from commencing much-needed construction work. This delay also holds up the relocation of slaughterhouses operating opposite the colony. Residents continue living in deteriorating houses while awaiting permanent housing solutions. The newly elected corporation council plans a detailed review to decide the project's future.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/thiruvananthapuram-housing-project-delayed-100-families-await-homes/132654225?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-1671775/132654225.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Virat Kohli, Anushka Sharma buy \u20b918.29 crore apartment in Mumbai\u2019s Versova", "para": "Virat Kohli and Anushka Sharma have bought an apartment in Godrej Skyshore, Versova, Andheri West, for \u20b918.29 crore, according to documents accessed by Zapkey. The apartment has a RERA carpet area of 245.71 sq metres, including adjacent exclusive area, and comes with three car parking spaces.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/virat-kohli-and-anushka-sharma-invest-1829-crore-in-lavish-mumbai-apartment/132652738?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-73242/132652738.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}